* NA6P VerTel default FLUKA geometry: silicon, carbon fibre and carbon foam
* Units: cm. Default plane z: 7.1175, 15.1175, 20.1175, 25.1175, 38.1175.
* The silicon is represented by front/back sensor envelopes; carbon-fibre
* plates and the outer-station carbon foam. Cooling, aluminium and steel are omitted.
* Window corners are represented by their rectangular bounding boxes.
GLOBAL           1.0                                     1.0                    
TITLE
NA6P VerTel: Si and C-fibre
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIOn 
